          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Sunflour Baking Mixes: Bake Our Recipes at Home</h2><p>These are the mixes we developed in our Charlotte, NC kitchens so you can bake Sunflour at home. Each mix uses the same recipe we use in our cafes, scaled for a home kitchen and packed with clear instructions. Real ingredients, real results.</p><p>Current mixes available for shipping: Cheddar Biscuit, Blueberry Muffin, Banana Muffin, Buttermilk Scone, and Chocolate Chip Cookie. Each one ships nationwide in packaging built to protect the mix in transit.</p><h3>A Gift Worth Making</h3><p>Baking mixes make an unusually good gift for the person who actually cooks. They are not a generic store-bought kit. They are a recipe people know from a real Charlotte bakery, with the ingredients already measured out. Pair a mix with a jar of local honey or a bag of good coffee and you have a complete kitchen gift without overthinking it.</p><p>For something ready to eat rather than ready to bake, our <a href=\"/collections/cookies\">freshly baked cookies</a> and <a href=\"/collections/cake-jars\">cake jars</a> ship nationwide from the same kitchens.</p>"
